{
  "sn22.49:0.1": "Linked Discourses 22.49 ",
  "sn22.49:0.2": "5. Be Your Own Island ",
  "sn22.49:0.3": "With Soṇa ",
  "sn22.49:1.1": "So I have heard. ",
  "sn22.49:1.2": "At one time the Buddha was staying near Rājagaha in the Bamboo Grove, the squirrels’ feeding ground. ",
  "sn22.49:1.3": "Then the householder Soṇa went up to the Buddha … ",
  "sn22.49:1.4": "The Buddha said to him: ",
  "sn22.49:2.1": "“Soṇa, there are ascetics and brahmins who—based on form, which is impermanent, suffering, and perishable—regard themselves thus: ‘I’m better’, ",
  "sn22.49:2.2": "or ‘I’m equal’, ",
  "sn22.49:2.3": "or ‘I’m worse’. ",
  "sn22.49:2.4": "What is that but a failure to see truly? ",
  "sn22.49:2.5": "Based on feeling … ",
  "sn22.49:2.6": "",
  "sn22.49:2.7": "",
  "sn22.49:2.8": "",
  "sn22.49:2.9": "perception … ",
  "sn22.49:2.10": "choices … ",
  "sn22.49:2.11": "",
  "sn22.49:2.12": "",
  "sn22.49:2.13": "",
  "sn22.49:2.14": "consciousness, which is impermanent, suffering, and perishable, they regard themselves thus: ‘I’m better’, ",
  "sn22.49:2.15": "or ‘I’m equal’, ",
  "sn22.49:2.16": "or ‘I’m worse’. ",
  "sn22.49:2.17": "What is that but a failure to see truly? ",
  "sn22.49:3.1": "There are ascetics and brahmins who—based on form, which is impermanent, suffering, and perishable—don’t regard themselves thus: ‘I’m better’, ",
  "sn22.49:3.2": "or ‘I’m equal’, ",
  "sn22.49:3.3": "or ‘I’m worse’. ",
  "sn22.49:3.4